WEBVTT

01:30.320 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:42.840 --> 01:43.840
Ningxi,

01:43.920 --> 01:45.240
this is the Sword of Vitality.

01:46.040 --> 01:47.000
It's yours now.

01:48.360 --> 01:49.520
Sword of Vitality.

01:49.600 --> 01:50.440
TWENTY YEARS AGO

01:50.520 --> 01:51.760
That's a beautiful name.

01:51.840 --> 01:52.680
RESTING WIND PAVILION

01:52.760 --> 01:54.120
I don't understand

01:54.200 --> 01:56.200
why you have to go back

01:56.720 --> 01:58.440
and you won't let me come with you.

01:59.960 --> 02:03.360
If your master hears
that you are leaving with me,

02:03.440 --> 02:05.120
she will make it hard for you.

02:06.280 --> 02:08.479
She wants you to marry Gao Fengxu,

02:09.919 --> 02:11.320
the leader of the Immortal Alliance.

02:11.400 --> 02:15.720
SU NINGXI

02:15.800 --> 02:17.680
I'm worried that you might be in danger.

02:18.560 --> 02:20.080
This is the only thing

02:20.160 --> 02:21.920
that I can't let my master decide.

02:22.480 --> 02:24.760
After I say goodbye to Master and Zhen,

02:24.840 --> 02:27.040
we can go to a place
where no one can find us.

02:27.120 --> 02:28.960
-What do you think?
-Great.

02:30.200 --> 02:33.200
When I'm not with you,
this will keep you safe.

02:38.520 --> 02:39.440
Ningxi!

02:40.480 --> 02:43.360
-Why?
-Because you disgust me.

02:45.720 --> 02:46.640
So,

02:46.720 --> 02:50.240
everything that happened between me
was just you tricking me.

02:50.840 --> 02:52.280
Eliminate all survivors
of the Canglang Clan!

02:52.360 --> 02:53.360
Yes.

02:54.400 --> 02:55.760
This is a trap

02:56.640 --> 02:57.920
from the beginning.

02:59.000 --> 03:01.440
I am the young madam of Mirage Palace.

03:01.520 --> 03:04.040
How could I fall for a despicable
Spirit Clan member like you?

03:29.640 --> 03:30.760
Saintess.

03:56.080 --> 03:57.240
I am surprised to see

03:57.320 --> 04:00.600
that there are things that can make
my master brood by himself.

04:06.560 --> 04:08.840
Why did you ask me to come here, Master?

04:17.640 --> 04:21.240
Your Demonic Vine of Judgement
was confiscated by the Immortal Alliance.

04:22.400 --> 04:25.400
This is the new artifact that I made you.

04:25.920 --> 04:27.440
The name is Disassociation.

04:29.280 --> 04:33.400
Its power is so much stronger
than the Demonic Vine of Judgement.

04:36.960 --> 04:38.280
Disassociation.

04:40.200 --> 04:41.240
I like the name.

04:42.560 --> 04:43.480
Thank you, Master.

04:46.720 --> 04:47.760
Master.

04:47.840 --> 04:50.240
The Decaying Immortal Pavilion
has acquired the Chaos Pearl.

04:50.320 --> 04:52.560
When are they going to deactivate
the Immortals Array?

04:52.640 --> 04:55.280
I want to pay the bunch
of the Immortal Alliance back.

04:58.480 --> 05:01.560
The Chaos Pearl in Snow City is a fake.

05:04.200 --> 05:07.600
The Chaos Pearl has always been sealed
in Snow City.

05:07.680 --> 05:09.120
How could that be a fake?

05:10.160 --> 05:11.960
Is the master
of the Decaying Immortal Pavilion

05:12.040 --> 05:13.440
trying not to pay us with an excuse?

05:15.800 --> 05:18.120
He's not that stupid.

05:18.200 --> 05:19.480
Master.

05:20.520 --> 05:24.440
I can go to the human world again
to find the real Chaos Pearl for you.

05:24.960 --> 05:26.320
That's not urgent.

05:27.280 --> 05:30.760
Your Jade Vault Technique
is not mature yet.

05:30.840 --> 05:34.320
You'd better stay in the Dark Abyss
and train for a while.

05:36.680 --> 05:38.120
Mr. Xie

05:38.200 --> 05:40.680
pitied you for losing your demonic power

05:40.760 --> 05:42.200
and taught you the Jade Vault Technique.

05:43.120 --> 05:45.960
You shouldn't waste his kindness.

05:47.840 --> 05:48.680
Yes.

05:51.720 --> 05:54.960
The beacon of righteousness?
Detached sword cultivator?

05:55.600 --> 05:58.920
With a little love scheme
and he is losing catastrophically.

06:01.800 --> 06:05.200
Why didn't I just kill him in one strike

06:05.960 --> 06:07.280
and be done with it?

06:07.800 --> 06:09.000
How nice would that be?

06:10.160 --> 06:11.320
Yes.

06:12.600 --> 06:15.720
Why didn't you just kill him?

06:18.200 --> 06:19.360
It's easy.

06:19.880 --> 06:21.760
When my Jade Vault Technique is ready,

06:22.280 --> 06:24.920
I will take Xie Xuechen's head down

06:25.000 --> 06:28.680
and hang it in the Temple
of Divine Execution as a keepsake for you.

06:34.360 --> 06:37.480
To guard the Chaos Pearl,
the Immortal Alliance paid a great price.

06:38.360 --> 06:40.480
All that just for a fake!

06:41.520 --> 06:45.360
But when was the Chaos Pearl switched?

06:45.440 --> 06:47.400
I think it was a fake

06:47.480 --> 06:48.880
that was put in the Pearl Tower
in the first place.

06:49.760 --> 06:52.560
I believe
that with Leader Xie's integrity,

06:53.080 --> 06:54.600
he will never do something like that.

06:55.600 --> 06:56.640
Besides,

06:56.720 --> 07:00.160
he guarded the Chaos Pearl with his life.

07:00.680 --> 07:01.960
So,

07:02.040 --> 07:04.920
we can remove him
from the list of suspects.

07:05.560 --> 07:08.080
Then it must have been switched
before it was put in the Pearl Tower.

07:08.600 --> 07:09.440
Is it

07:10.200 --> 07:11.480
Moonlight Heights?

07:15.040 --> 07:16.600
What we can be sure of

07:16.680 --> 07:20.360
is that the real Chaos Pearl
is not in the Decaying Immortal Pavilion.

07:20.440 --> 07:22.280
That's one thing to be glad about.

07:25.560 --> 07:27.480
The Chaos Pearl was lost in Snow City.

07:27.560 --> 07:29.040
I will be responsible

07:29.120 --> 07:31.800
for finding the real one
and give everyone closure.

07:37.040 --> 07:38.720
But you guys should understand

07:39.640 --> 07:40.920
that the Immortal Alliance

07:41.000 --> 07:43.640
is never about guarding
one specific artifact.

07:44.360 --> 07:47.440
It is guarding the tranquil life
of humanity and peace of the world.

07:47.520 --> 07:49.640
Whether the Chaos Pearl is real or not,

07:50.160 --> 07:52.880
our goal will never change.

07:53.920 --> 07:55.520
I'm just glad that Mr. Xie is okay.

07:57.200 --> 07:59.640
We are waiting here today

08:00.360 --> 08:03.360
because we want to ask Mr. Xie something.

08:04.800 --> 08:07.960
The Jade Sky Palace hopes Mr. Xie
can succeed as the alliance leader.

08:08.720 --> 08:10.920
Mr. Xie put aside your personal safety

08:11.000 --> 08:12.920
and saved humanity multiple times.

08:13.000 --> 08:15.440
You are the one with the most credit
in the Immortal Alliance

08:15.520 --> 08:17.560
and the one that we trust the most.

08:17.640 --> 08:19.680
The Jade Sky Palace
would like to follow Mr. Xie

08:19.760 --> 08:21.080
to keep guarding humanity.

08:21.760 --> 08:24.240
The Osprey Island
would love to follow Mr. Xie.

08:24.840 --> 08:27.320
The Xuantian Sect
would like to follow Mr. Xie.

08:32.919 --> 08:35.320
The Mirage Palace
would like to follow Mr. Xie.

08:42.559 --> 08:44.280
I have no intention in that position.

08:44.880 --> 08:47.280
I have to ask you
to find another candidate.

08:53.960 --> 08:54.800
Mr. Xie.

08:57.120 --> 08:59.640
When Sang Qi and the Decaying
Immortal Pavilion attacked,

09:00.640 --> 09:02.120
we didn't have enough power to fight them

09:02.200 --> 09:04.240
and brought danger to the people
and the Chaos Pearl.

09:04.320 --> 09:07.720
That's our failure, and the fault is ours.

09:08.760 --> 09:12.360
Thanks to you,
it was not all ruined that night.

09:13.520 --> 09:14.760
We know what we saw.

09:15.360 --> 09:18.760
We can't live up to the code
of the Immortal Alliance.

09:21.440 --> 09:24.160
Mr. Xie may not
be interested in the position,

09:25.040 --> 09:27.760
but the Immortal Alliance
is in urgent need of a new leader

09:27.840 --> 09:29.840
to keep going,

09:29.920 --> 09:31.120
and humanity

09:31.200 --> 09:34.320
can have hopes and a future.

09:35.880 --> 09:36.840
Therefore,

09:38.560 --> 09:40.840
we plead with Mr. Xie
to accept the position.

09:41.680 --> 09:43.400
Please accept the position.

09:48.880 --> 09:50.680
I can be the acting alliance leader
for the time being.

09:50.760 --> 09:52.120
After all of this is over,

09:52.200 --> 09:55.080
we'll have to select another leader
for the Immortal Alliance.

09:55.680 --> 09:56.600
For the time being?

09:56.680 --> 09:58.360
-What…
-News of missing Chaos Pearl will get out.

09:58.440 --> 10:02.560
Masters, please return to your cities
and ease people's minds.

10:03.320 --> 10:06.720
I will take the disciples of Snow City
to guard the Two Realms Mountain

10:07.240 --> 10:08.840
and watch out for any actions
from the Dark Abyss.

10:10.040 --> 10:11.800
Mirage Palace is the closest
to the Two Realms Mountain.

10:12.320 --> 10:15.040
Madam Su, please send help.

10:16.920 --> 10:17.760
Yes.

10:18.520 --> 10:20.040
Yes, Leader Xie.

10:32.360 --> 10:34.040
The Immortal Alliance does respect you,

10:34.560 --> 10:36.600
but they are also pushing you
to the frontline.

10:38.520 --> 10:42.160
The imposed position brings no benefit.

10:42.240 --> 10:44.800
Your experience boils down to five words.

10:44.880 --> 10:47.200
No good deed goes unpunished.

10:50.920 --> 10:53.120
The Two Realms Mountain
is just by the Dark Abyss.

10:53.640 --> 10:54.760
That means she's close.

10:55.880 --> 10:57.040
Do you want to save her?

10:57.120 --> 10:58.280
How about you?

10:59.880 --> 11:01.600
Are you acting on your own
or coming with me?

11:06.840 --> 11:08.440
You need to find the Chaos Pearl,

11:09.120 --> 11:10.880
guard the Immortals Array,

11:10.960 --> 11:13.160
stay vigilant about the Spirit Clan
and the Dark Clan,

11:14.080 --> 11:15.440
and save her.

11:16.680 --> 11:18.440
If I don't go with you,

11:19.480 --> 11:21.400
you will be the first leader
of the Immortal Alliance

11:22.320 --> 11:24.200
who dies overworking.

11:27.760 --> 11:29.160
Before we set off,

11:29.720 --> 11:31.400
there's an arrangement
that I need to make.

11:34.320 --> 11:35.760
Miss Gao, do you know

11:36.280 --> 11:38.720
how the Chaos Pearl was delivered
to Snow City?

11:41.880 --> 11:45.760
Sang Qi and his demon troops
attacked Moonlight Heights.

11:45.840 --> 11:48.800
I was young. My memory is a blur.

11:49.400 --> 11:51.560
All I know is that the then-lord
of Mirage Palace,

11:51.640 --> 11:52.800
Saint Miaohua, got there.

11:53.400 --> 11:55.320
I was saved,
and the Chaos Pearl was brought away.

11:55.400 --> 11:57.880
Saint Miaohua is Madam Su's master, right?

11:58.400 --> 11:59.400
Yes.

11:59.480 --> 12:01.720
My mother and my master are sisters.

12:01.800 --> 12:03.720
She was also Saint Miaohua's disciple.

12:04.320 --> 12:07.040
It's just that my mother died

12:08.000 --> 12:09.360
when giving birth to me.

12:10.080 --> 12:12.520
Saint Miaohua was the one
who brought the Chaos Pearl

12:12.600 --> 12:13.640
to Snow City.

12:14.840 --> 12:17.120
My father was also there
when the pearl was sealed in the tower.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.720
I asked Elder Cang.

12:19.240 --> 12:20.920
The Pearl Tower was never opened
over the years.

12:21.720 --> 12:23.200
No abnormalities as well.

12:23.880 --> 12:24.840
What are you trying to say?

12:26.480 --> 12:28.640
My father guarded the Chaos Pearl
until his last breath.

12:29.160 --> 12:31.600
Snow City has nothing
to do with this, no doubt.

12:32.280 --> 12:33.760
There's only one possibility left.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.880
The Chaos Pearl that was delivered
to Snow City

12:37.600 --> 12:38.560
was a fake.

12:39.920 --> 12:42.240
Are you saying
that the Mirage Palace is the thief

12:42.320 --> 12:44.720
and that Saint Miaohua and my master
faked the pearl

12:44.800 --> 12:46.360
to take the real one for themselves?

12:46.440 --> 12:47.680
The Mirage Palace is not my enemy

12:47.760 --> 12:49.440
or the Snow City's enemy.

12:49.520 --> 12:51.280
I just want to find the Chaos Pearl

12:51.360 --> 12:53.120
to stop Decaying Immortal Pavilion
and the Dark Clan.

12:53.640 --> 12:57.040
I'm having this talk with you
not to blame anyone.

12:58.000 --> 12:59.280
I need a favor.

13:00.840 --> 13:02.160
Do you want me

13:02.240 --> 13:04.040
-to investigate my master for you?
-Yes.

13:04.120 --> 13:06.800
Shortly after what happened
to Moonlight Heights,

13:07.320 --> 13:09.680
Saint Miaohua gave the leadership
to Madam Su

13:09.760 --> 13:10.840
and was never seen again.

13:11.920 --> 13:14.400
Madam Su is the one
most likely to know what happened.

13:15.280 --> 13:17.640
Sang Qi and my master
must have been good friends.

13:18.400 --> 13:20.200
One brought massacre
upon Moonlight Heights,

13:20.280 --> 13:22.000
while the other stole
the important artifact.

13:22.520 --> 13:23.920
In that case,

13:24.000 --> 13:26.080
why did Sang Qi come to Snow City?

13:29.200 --> 13:31.520
If you have no doubts,

13:32.120 --> 13:33.480
you wouldn't have come to see me.

13:34.400 --> 13:37.720
You also want the truth, don't you?

13:46.080 --> 13:47.320
Mr. Xie.

13:47.840 --> 13:51.120
I've collected all the things
that Xuanling left behind.

13:51.640 --> 13:54.520
Should we seal them off or…

14:09.640 --> 14:13.400
Classes, chores, and shifts.

14:14.320 --> 14:16.960
Life in Snow City is so boring.

14:17.720 --> 14:20.600
The process of becoming
a common human is so long.

14:20.680 --> 14:21.560
I DRANK TEA WATER FROM HIS CUP

14:25.560 --> 14:27.520
HE BROUGHT A LOT OF SWORDS TO ME
AND I DIDN'T LIKE ANY ONE OF THEM

14:28.120 --> 14:29.040
It's strange.

14:29.560 --> 14:32.920
I found the boring people
and events in Snow City

14:33.000 --> 14:34.120
are interesting in a way.

14:35.440 --> 14:39.080
Did they become more interesting,
or have I become boring?

14:45.160 --> 14:47.960
It turns out that I have never escaped

14:48.480 --> 14:50.480
Sang Qi's control.

14:52.000 --> 14:54.280
Am I never getting what I want?

14:55.440 --> 14:58.240
In the past and in the present.

15:01.680 --> 15:02.760
Never mind.

15:02.840 --> 15:04.240
Let death come.

15:04.960 --> 15:07.040
I will help Xie Xuechen

15:07.560 --> 15:09.360
to guard the things
he wants to guard for this once.

15:11.400 --> 15:14.000
Put everything back as they were.

15:14.520 --> 15:17.520
Keep everything.

15:17.600 --> 15:19.040
Mr. Xie, are you saying

15:19.560 --> 15:21.360
-that she might come back?
-Yes.

15:23.760 --> 15:24.600
Understood.

15:38.480 --> 15:40.720
TEMPLE OF DIVINE EXECUTION

15:42.720 --> 15:45.680
I heard that the Saintess managed

15:45.760 --> 15:47.320
to activate spiritual channels
as a Spirit Clan member!

15:47.960 --> 15:50.960
She's training
with spiritual power today, right?

15:52.160 --> 15:56.160
I wonder between spiritual power
and demonic power, which one is stronger?

16:06.360 --> 16:08.400
Since you are so curious
about the spiritual power,

16:08.480 --> 16:11.040
you can taste it yourselves.

16:11.560 --> 16:14.880
Cultivations with spiritual power
and demonic power are similar.

16:14.960 --> 16:17.040
They are both about accumulating power

16:17.120 --> 16:18.800
and mastering it.

16:18.880 --> 16:22.120
The key is to keep practicing.

16:23.120 --> 16:24.640
Saintess! Spare us!

16:25.760 --> 16:28.360
I just need to keep a fine control
over spiritual power,

16:28.440 --> 16:30.600
to not kill a Dark Clan member
in an instant.

16:30.680 --> 16:31.920
Just like fire

16:32.640 --> 16:35.080
won't burn a candle down in an instant.

16:36.000 --> 16:37.040
Saintess!

16:43.920 --> 16:44.760
It's been a while.

16:44.840 --> 16:47.480
Ignorance Demon and Anger Demon
have been avoiding me.

16:47.560 --> 16:50.560
Do you still mind
what happened in the human world?

16:51.400 --> 16:54.720
Or do you think less of me since I've lost

16:54.800 --> 16:56.160
my demonic power?

16:56.240 --> 16:58.240
How ruthless are my comrades?

16:58.320 --> 16:59.800
Don't be ridiculous.

17:00.400 --> 17:03.240
His Grace trusts you as always.

17:03.320 --> 17:04.920
We heard that

17:05.000 --> 17:07.040
you've been busy cultivating
spiritual power,

17:07.119 --> 17:09.680
and we didn't want to disturb you.

17:13.040 --> 17:14.760
Do you think you have the right

17:15.280 --> 17:17.760
to stick your noses in my business?

17:23.359 --> 17:26.839
You said that you didn't
want to disturb me.

17:28.840 --> 17:33.480
What's so important
that changed your mind?

17:36.840 --> 17:38.280
His Grace summoned you.

17:40.320 --> 17:41.240
Now?

17:44.400 --> 17:47.800
Master. Are you finally letting me go
to the human world?

18:07.560 --> 18:10.440
I heard that you took
quite a few Dark Clan members.

18:12.320 --> 18:14.560
I was just focusing
on improving the Jade Vault Technique

18:14.640 --> 18:16.360
as you've requested.

18:18.040 --> 18:20.360
It seems that you did well.

18:24.120 --> 18:25.280
Go, then.

18:26.520 --> 18:28.520
Do you know where to get started?

18:28.600 --> 18:29.880
Mirage Palace.

18:30.520 --> 18:32.480
Their young madam, Gao Qiumin,

18:32.560 --> 18:35.720
is a good friend since Moonlight Heights.

18:36.240 --> 18:39.080
I believe that she will help me
find the Chaos Pearl.

18:40.240 --> 18:41.080
Good.

18:41.680 --> 18:42.920
Master.

18:44.400 --> 18:45.600
Do you trust me?

18:48.320 --> 18:49.400
Where did that come from?

18:51.320 --> 18:52.360
No reason.

18:53.480 --> 18:54.720
I'm just worried

18:54.800 --> 18:56.120
that if I fail

18:56.200 --> 18:59.000
to get the Chaos Pearl from Xie Xuechen,

18:59.080 --> 19:02.760
you might doubt
my loyalty because of that.

19:22.520 --> 19:23.800
You shouldn't worry about that.

19:27.200 --> 19:28.040
Go.

19:33.680 --> 19:35.280
Mu Xuanling is a Spirit Clan member,

19:35.360 --> 19:37.600
yet she acts
like she's a Dark Clan member.

19:38.200 --> 19:39.560
She's a little different
after she returned.

19:40.160 --> 19:41.000
No.

19:41.520 --> 19:43.480
Maybe she has gotten better at pretending.

19:46.600 --> 19:49.600
His Grace is also a member
of the Spirit Clan.

19:51.840 --> 19:53.200
If you ask me,

19:53.280 --> 19:55.880
no one is more like a Dark Clan member
than His Grace.

20:00.880 --> 20:02.640
She betrayed us for a human,

20:02.720 --> 20:04.400
and she will do it again.

20:05.920 --> 20:08.560
I will never believe
that she'd be loyal to His Grace.

20:09.240 --> 20:10.120
Your Grace.

20:10.200 --> 20:12.360
-What is the Saintess's--
-You don't need to know that.

20:14.320 --> 20:15.360
What about you?

20:15.880 --> 20:18.600
I have acquired the Jade Vault Technique

20:19.240 --> 20:20.720
and activated spiritual channels.

20:22.000 --> 20:25.040
I just need to train for a few days longer

20:25.120 --> 20:29.600
to completely control
both spiritual power and demonic power.

20:30.400 --> 20:33.000
I will defeat our enemies
with their weapon.

20:35.680 --> 20:37.120
Isn't that interesting?

20:39.760 --> 20:40.800
Yes.

21:15.640 --> 21:17.440
I didn't get such a warm welcome

21:17.520 --> 21:19.560
the last time I came to the human world.

21:19.640 --> 21:20.800
Mu Xuanling!

21:20.880 --> 21:22.800
Her Grace asked us to inspect
the Two Realms Mountain every day

21:22.880 --> 21:25.280
to avoid the Dark Abyss and Spirit Clan
invade the human world again.

21:25.360 --> 21:27.640
Look what the cat dragged in!
Isn't it the Saintess of the Dark Abyss?

21:28.240 --> 21:29.800
Su Ningzhen.

21:31.160 --> 21:33.440
It seems that she has been thinking
about Master and I.

21:42.440 --> 21:45.400
I didn't expect to be spotted
right after arriving in the human world.

21:45.920 --> 21:47.080
Well,

21:47.160 --> 21:50.400
to avoid my whereabouts getting out,
maybe I should kill you all.

21:53.520 --> 21:55.520
How are you using spiritual power?

21:56.120 --> 21:57.800
Isn't that interesting?

21:58.800 --> 22:00.080
Stop…

22:02.560 --> 22:04.080
I wonder if your soul

22:04.160 --> 22:06.520
burns faster than Dark Clan members.

22:19.320 --> 22:20.560
Mr. Nan,

22:21.280 --> 22:22.920
I knew it was you.

22:23.000 --> 22:24.080
Ms. Mu!

22:25.000 --> 22:25.840
Here we meet again.

22:27.400 --> 22:28.800
How did you manage to escape?

22:29.440 --> 22:30.320
Escape?

22:32.920 --> 22:36.120
After Sang Qi took you,
I've been worried that he might hurt you.

22:37.520 --> 22:39.480
Mr. Nan, I think
you've misunderstood something.

22:40.200 --> 22:44.160
I was trapped in Snow City,
and Master was here to bring me home.

22:44.240 --> 22:45.440
He has treated me really well.

22:45.520 --> 22:47.000
How could he hurt me?

22:48.400 --> 22:49.240
Go home?

22:52.200 --> 22:54.840
Mr. Nan, we have spent time together.

22:54.920 --> 22:55.880
But if you are going to help

22:55.960 --> 22:58.000
those cultivators
from the Immortal Alliance,

22:58.080 --> 23:00.280
I will not go easy on you.

23:02.760 --> 23:05.200
Ms. Mu. Why don't you tell me

23:05.720 --> 23:08.640
what happened
after you got back to the Dark Abyss?

23:09.240 --> 23:10.440
To think back,

23:10.520 --> 23:13.240
Nan Xuyue seems to care about me in a way.

23:13.320 --> 23:14.800
Mr. Nan,

23:14.880 --> 23:16.880
I've let my master down.

23:16.960 --> 23:18.720
I need to find a way to make it up.

23:18.800 --> 23:21.160
Mr. Nan, since you care about me,

23:21.240 --> 23:22.920
maybe you can help me out.

23:24.880 --> 23:26.000
You are…

23:28.080 --> 23:30.880
What do you want me to do?

23:32.480 --> 23:33.920
To start with,

23:34.000 --> 23:36.600
deactivate all the arrays in this forest

23:37.120 --> 23:39.640
and let me kill all of those cultivators.

23:41.640 --> 23:42.640
Then what?

23:43.360 --> 23:44.520
Keep trying to take the Chaos Pearl?

23:46.760 --> 23:49.320
You are always so smart.

23:49.400 --> 23:50.600
I always knew

23:50.680 --> 23:52.360
that you are different from Xie Xuechen.

23:52.440 --> 23:55.760
You don't care
about the Immortal Alliance or humanity.

23:55.840 --> 23:57.880
You are helping Xie Xuechen

23:57.960 --> 24:00.760
because you want to see
what interesting things you can find

24:00.840 --> 24:02.800
in this boring world.

24:02.880 --> 24:05.800
What you really care about

24:07.280 --> 24:08.280
is me.

24:09.000 --> 24:09.960
Am I right?

24:11.960 --> 24:13.560
I can see you,

24:13.640 --> 24:15.160
and you can see me as well.

24:16.000 --> 24:17.240
Mr. Nan,

24:17.760 --> 24:19.560
join me.

24:20.240 --> 24:21.760
I can give you what you want.

24:22.520 --> 24:23.640
That includes

24:25.040 --> 24:26.480
that "little affection".

24:55.680 --> 24:57.920
The Spirit Clan's life span
is over a thousand years.

24:58.000 --> 25:00.240
It is a wide world full of men.

25:00.880 --> 25:03.760
Why would I give up my life
for Xie Xuechen, who is just a guy?

25:05.560 --> 25:07.880
I've played your admirer for long enough.

25:08.400 --> 25:09.640
It has become tiring.

25:11.600 --> 25:13.080
Enemies always meet.

25:13.600 --> 25:15.800
I don't think Xie Xuechen
will cut me any slacks anymore.

25:20.440 --> 25:21.400
Mu Xuanling!

25:35.000 --> 25:36.040
Mu Xuanling!

25:37.200 --> 25:38.560
Since you have gotten out,

25:39.080 --> 25:40.280
why are you running?

26:01.080 --> 26:02.080
You are trying to kill me.

26:03.760 --> 26:06.400
It's a shame that I failed.

26:17.520 --> 26:18.840
Why not pursue her?

26:19.840 --> 26:22.280
Xie Xuechen is there. She won't get away.

26:23.560 --> 26:25.120
She's a little weird.

26:25.200 --> 26:29.080
The mole under her eye
is called Mundane Tear.

26:29.160 --> 26:30.840
It's the sign
of drinking the Disillusion Water.

26:31.440 --> 26:32.560
The Disillusion Water?

26:35.240 --> 26:37.200
It is documented in the Greenview Archive.

26:37.840 --> 26:39.800
It's a type of medicine
that makes people forget about love.

26:40.800 --> 26:41.840
Forget about love.

26:42.720 --> 26:44.280
Why would she take it?

26:44.360 --> 26:45.600
Should we let Xie Xuechen know?

26:45.680 --> 26:47.360
No matter what the reason might be,

26:47.880 --> 26:49.800
she has forgotten
all kinds of personal feelings.

26:53.480 --> 26:56.720
If it's you, would you tell Xie Xuechen?

26:59.520 --> 27:01.200
But she doesn't love Xie Xuechen

27:03.240 --> 27:04.360
or you.

27:07.680 --> 27:08.560
I know.

27:10.200 --> 27:13.600
You saw it in your divination, didn't you?
The ending of Xie Xuechen and her.

27:21.400 --> 27:22.680
How will they end?

27:27.000 --> 27:28.400
A relationship with no results.

27:49.360 --> 27:52.160
The coldness and the intention
to kill in her eyes was real.

27:53.680 --> 27:57.160
Is it because I left her behind
and that hurt her?

28:06.360 --> 28:07.800
That was a bad beginning.

28:08.320 --> 28:10.880
Why does it have to be the most difficult
target in the Immortal Alliance?

28:11.680 --> 28:14.800
Xie Xuechen is a shrewd man.

28:15.480 --> 28:16.920
Fighting him head-to-head will not do.

28:17.640 --> 28:19.240
I need to be smart about this.

28:41.680 --> 28:42.640
Xie Xuechen.

28:44.000 --> 28:45.480
Say something.

28:47.040 --> 28:48.400
Stop reading.

28:53.720 --> 28:58.080
Do you want to know
why I attacked you earlier?

28:58.680 --> 28:59.640
You know this.

29:00.320 --> 29:02.800
Sang Qi put Heartstring on me.

29:02.880 --> 29:04.520
It wasn't me who tried to kill you.

29:04.600 --> 29:06.240
He controlled me.

29:06.800 --> 29:08.080
Xie Xuechen.

29:08.160 --> 29:11.200
What I said that day

29:11.760 --> 29:13.600
was not my intention.

29:16.840 --> 29:18.840
How could I not love you?

29:19.480 --> 29:20.880
I went through all kinds of dangers

29:21.800 --> 29:23.440
to escape the Dark Abyss

29:24.120 --> 29:26.240
just so that I can get back to you

29:26.880 --> 29:28.720
and be with you forever.

29:31.400 --> 29:32.560
What happened to you?

29:45.800 --> 29:47.480
We haven't seen each other for so long.

29:48.920 --> 29:50.960
Don't you miss me?

29:52.520 --> 29:54.640
They say that a short time apart
makes the couple miss each other more.

29:55.840 --> 29:58.520
You've set a barrier outside.

29:59.160 --> 30:00.400
No one can get in.

30:01.800 --> 30:03.320
How about…

30:08.400 --> 30:09.600
I have other plans.

30:11.000 --> 30:12.280
You should rest.

30:21.160 --> 30:24.520
Just as expected.
This is the way to make him leave.

30:57.600 --> 30:58.880
Master.

30:59.400 --> 31:00.960
Luck did not favor me.

31:01.920 --> 31:04.080
I met our nemesis, Xie Xuechen.

31:04.160 --> 31:05.440
What?

31:06.640 --> 31:08.560
Already got caught
when you just arrived in the human world

31:08.640 --> 31:10.520
and you want me to save you?

31:10.600 --> 31:11.880
That's not necessary.

31:11.960 --> 31:15.200
But I do have another plan.

31:17.920 --> 31:20.680
Xie Xuechen will not give up
on searching for the Chaos Pearl.

31:21.280 --> 31:22.520
With him.

31:22.600 --> 31:25.200
I don't need to go to Mirage Palace
and find Gao Qiumin.

31:26.000 --> 31:27.400
So,

31:28.800 --> 31:30.120
I want to stay close to him.

31:30.200 --> 31:32.640
Even if I can't get
the Chaos Pearl directly,

31:32.720 --> 31:35.440
I will get clues.

31:36.240 --> 31:37.240
Are you sure

31:38.640 --> 31:39.600
that he will allow you?

31:41.400 --> 31:44.800
That's why I'd like to ask you
to do something for me.

31:46.520 --> 31:49.440
If Xie Xuechen can witness
that I suffer from Heartstring,

31:50.760 --> 31:53.120
how could he leave me here by myself?

31:59.200 --> 32:00.200
All right.

32:01.040 --> 32:04.160
Tonight, I will help you
put on another show.

32:11.720 --> 32:12.920
I always knew that

32:13.000 --> 32:15.040
you are different from Xie Xuechen.

32:15.120 --> 32:18.400
You don't care
about the Immortal Alliance or humanity.

32:18.920 --> 32:22.560
What you really care about

32:23.080 --> 32:23.920
is me.

32:24.760 --> 32:25.760
Am I right?

32:26.440 --> 32:27.640
I can see you,

32:28.160 --> 32:29.560
and you can see me as well.

32:30.080 --> 32:31.480
Mr. Nan,

32:31.560 --> 32:33.160
join me.

32:33.760 --> 32:35.480
I can give you what you want.

32:35.560 --> 32:36.680
That includes

32:38.040 --> 32:39.720
that "little affection".

32:54.200 --> 32:56.000
I knew you would visit.

32:57.840 --> 33:00.080
Do you also feel that there's something
strange about her?

33:00.960 --> 33:02.080
Her tone, behaviors,

33:02.600 --> 33:03.840
expressions, vibe,

33:03.920 --> 33:06.240
and the grey mole under her eye…

33:06.320 --> 33:07.680
Everything is strange.

33:08.320 --> 33:10.000
But her mind is clear.

33:10.080 --> 33:13.240
There's no sign of her being controlled
like when we were in Snow City.

33:15.000 --> 33:17.920
Just ask what you want to know.

33:19.040 --> 33:21.680
What were you talking about in the forest?

33:22.760 --> 33:24.920
She said that she was here
for the Chaos Pearl,

33:25.000 --> 33:26.480
and she wanted me to help her.

33:26.560 --> 33:29.280
In return, she will give me what I want.

33:31.320 --> 33:32.560
What you want?

33:34.640 --> 33:35.680
Her affection.

33:39.720 --> 33:40.840
Nan Xuyue.

33:41.760 --> 33:42.840
You do know how to annoy people.

33:44.480 --> 33:47.160
You asked. I was just telling the truth.

33:52.680 --> 33:54.760
She has betrayed the Dark Abyss
and joined me.

33:55.280 --> 33:56.840
She never liked human beings.

33:57.600 --> 33:58.440
Yet for me,

33:59.640 --> 34:01.280
for the people I want to protect,

34:01.800 --> 34:05.160
she risked everything, including her life.

34:06.200 --> 34:09.719
I left her behind that day
and allowed her to be taken by Sang Qi.

34:10.400 --> 34:11.679
That was all my fault.

34:12.360 --> 34:15.480
I left her behind once.
That will never happen again.

34:16.000 --> 34:18.679
If the Immortal Alliance
won't tolerate her, I will protect her.

34:23.159 --> 34:26.280
Mr. Xie, you are finally living
like a common person.

34:27.440 --> 34:29.080
Just like when I first met you.

34:30.239 --> 34:33.719
You have desires, persistence,
and do not accept restraining.

34:34.639 --> 34:36.639
Always trying to win.

34:36.719 --> 34:38.040
It's not about win or lose
when it comes to her.

34:38.880 --> 34:41.600
I will never let her go again.

34:43.679 --> 34:45.480
Even if you have feelings for her,

34:46.560 --> 34:48.040
I will not cut you any slacks.

34:55.199 --> 34:56.159
I know.

34:57.160 --> 35:00.400
I knew that when you decided
to come to the Two Realms Mountain.

35:02.440 --> 35:05.080
Oh, right! I need
to talk to you about something.

35:06.200 --> 35:09.120
There's an emergency that requires me
to go back to Greenview Heights.

35:09.200 --> 35:10.120
I'm leaving early in the morning.

35:10.760 --> 35:11.600
What is it?

35:15.280 --> 35:17.240
-It's a secret.
-Fine.

35:18.480 --> 35:19.720
Don't tell me.

35:23.200 --> 35:26.160
It's just that I haven't
thought this through myself.

35:27.400 --> 35:30.480
If I want to share this secret one day,

35:31.280 --> 35:32.440
you will hear it.

35:33.960 --> 35:34.800
Okay.

35:38.200 --> 35:39.400
What about the Chaos Pearl?

35:40.640 --> 35:41.760
Any news?

35:42.360 --> 35:44.000
I asked Gao Qiumin to help me
with the investigation.

35:44.800 --> 35:46.840
She might be the young madam
of Mirage Palace,

35:47.360 --> 35:49.000
she was also once the young madam
of Moonlight Heights.

35:49.800 --> 35:50.920
I believe

35:51.880 --> 35:53.600
that she doesn't want
the truth buried as well.

36:06.960 --> 36:08.000
Master.

36:08.880 --> 36:09.720
Be careful, it's hot.

36:20.960 --> 36:22.800
You've been trying
to say something lately.

36:23.320 --> 36:24.760
Spit it out.

36:28.920 --> 36:29.760
Master.

36:29.840 --> 36:32.240
What's the connection
between Sang Qi and my mother?

36:32.320 --> 36:34.240
Why did the Sword of Vitality deem him
as the master?

36:34.320 --> 36:36.960
How can you connect him to your mother?

36:38.520 --> 36:40.640
She was obsessed with my sister

36:40.720 --> 36:42.600
and gave her the Sword of Vitality.

36:43.320 --> 36:46.240
How could my sister
ever fall for a Spirit Clan member?

36:47.160 --> 36:49.440
She was just too kind.

36:49.960 --> 36:51.680
She felt sorry after driving him off

36:52.680 --> 36:54.440
and kept the sword.

36:57.600 --> 37:00.400
Is that the whole truth?

37:03.080 --> 37:03.920
Qiumin.

37:06.320 --> 37:09.280
-Master.
-You are born with nine apertures.

37:09.360 --> 37:11.080
Though not as talented as Xie Xuechen,

37:12.160 --> 37:14.560
you are still one
of the best among your peers.

37:15.200 --> 37:17.440
But you've been too easy on yourself.

37:17.520 --> 37:19.920
Until now,
you are still in the Golden Core stage.

37:21.200 --> 37:24.040
I asked you to come here
to channel my power to you.

37:25.080 --> 37:27.040
Master. You are not fully recovered.

37:27.120 --> 37:30.280
-If you give me your power--
-You don't have time to waste.

37:30.360 --> 37:32.000
I will train harder.

37:41.720 --> 37:44.720
Sang Qi and Mirage Palace
have a life-and-death vendetta.

37:45.320 --> 37:47.360
Since he won't stay quietly
in that small Dark Abyss,

37:47.440 --> 37:49.560
he will be looking for a chance
to pay us back.

37:50.360 --> 37:52.520
Besides,
now that the Chaos Pearl is missing,

37:54.400 --> 37:57.240
he's not the only one
watching Mirage Palace right now.

37:58.960 --> 38:01.160
The world is different.

38:02.480 --> 38:05.280
It's getting more and more dangerous.
Do you understand?

38:07.000 --> 38:07.960
Yes.

38:43.240 --> 38:45.400
Master! Are you all right?

38:46.080 --> 38:47.120
I'm fine.

38:50.360 --> 38:51.320
Master,

38:52.520 --> 38:53.800
your hair…

38:57.880 --> 38:59.600
-Leave me.
-Master.

38:59.680 --> 39:01.040
Go.

39:18.200 --> 39:22.440
PLANTATION PAVILION

39:26.000 --> 39:27.160
Elder Zai Xi.

39:27.240 --> 39:28.600
Have you been waiting for long?

39:28.680 --> 39:30.680
I'm here to talk to Madam.

39:31.560 --> 39:33.200
It seems that I'm too late.

39:33.960 --> 39:35.200
Go back.

39:37.640 --> 39:38.480
Yes.

39:52.560 --> 39:54.000
Now that the Chaos Pearl is missing,

39:54.080 --> 39:57.480
he's not the only one
watching Mirage Palace right now.

39:59.320 --> 40:01.960
The world is different.

40:03.280 --> 40:06.360
It's getting more and more dangerous.
Do you understand?

40:08.280 --> 40:10.480
Madam Su is the one
most likely to know what happened.

40:10.560 --> 40:12.120
You also want the truth,

40:12.960 --> 40:13.800
don't you?

40:15.880 --> 40:17.560
By danger,

40:18.080 --> 40:21.080
is Master referring to Sang Qi
or Xie Xuechen?

40:21.600 --> 40:23.240
Why are you in a rush
to give Qiumin your power?

40:24.840 --> 40:26.200
The Chaos Pearl is missing.

40:26.280 --> 40:28.880
A lot of eyes are on Mirage Palace.

40:30.840 --> 40:33.400
The Immortals Array
can no longer constrain the Dark Clan.

40:34.000 --> 40:36.480
The rodents lurking in the darkness

40:36.560 --> 40:38.640
will come to Mirage Palace
sooner or later.

40:39.480 --> 40:42.760
I can face my death, but not Qiumin.

40:43.680 --> 40:45.520
Moonlight Heights is no more,

40:45.600 --> 40:47.160
and Ningxi is dead.

40:47.240 --> 40:49.320
Sang Qi may not come to Mirage Palace.

40:50.720 --> 40:53.560
He can't wait to burn Mirage Palace
to the ground

40:53.640 --> 40:55.960
and remove the one who cost him
his arm completely from this world.

40:56.040 --> 40:57.120
Why wouldn't he come?

40:59.720 --> 41:01.520
If your sister didn't fall
for that Spirit Clan member…

41:01.600 --> 41:02.800
My sister did nothing wrong.

41:03.320 --> 41:05.280
It was Sang Qi who lured her…

41:05.360 --> 41:07.360
And Miaohua made her marry Gao Fengxu.

41:07.960 --> 41:11.040
Miaohua did it for Mirage Palace.

41:11.920 --> 41:12.760
Otherwise,

41:12.840 --> 41:14.880
how would Gao Fengxu agree
to leave the Chaos Pearl

41:14.960 --> 41:16.520
with Mirage Palace for a hundred years?

41:16.600 --> 41:17.800
Yes.

41:18.560 --> 41:21.200
Gao Fengxu wanted
to restore the power of the Chaos Pearl,

41:21.760 --> 41:24.000
and Mirage Palace coveted
that piece of unparalleled treasure.

41:25.280 --> 41:28.080
Why not sacrifice just one person?

41:30.160 --> 41:32.880
Miaohua never saw her as a disciple.

41:32.960 --> 41:34.400
She cared for my sister

41:34.480 --> 41:37.800
because she has the body
of a Primal Celestial Maiden.

41:43.480 --> 41:45.880
The body of a Primal Celestial Maiden?

41:46.760 --> 41:48.880
That kind of body
contains endless vitality.

41:49.680 --> 41:52.840
Reviving people
are already magical for common people.

41:53.360 --> 41:55.040
Who would have thought

41:55.120 --> 41:58.880
that she could be
the container that nourishes objects!

41:59.720 --> 42:01.720
Are you still holding on to all that?

42:01.800 --> 42:03.920
You've made Miaohua pay a great price.

42:04.000 --> 42:06.040
That's far from enough.

42:16.240 --> 42:17.440
It's all in the past.

42:17.520 --> 42:19.560
You are the lord of Mirage Palace now.

42:20.400 --> 42:23.000
Qiumin knew that Sang Qi
shares a connection with her mother.

42:23.520 --> 42:25.440
She will not let this slide.

42:26.080 --> 42:28.080
She will ask the wrong questions.

42:28.760 --> 42:30.800
Once someone gets curious,

42:30.880 --> 42:33.880
the buried secret will be revealed.

42:34.400 --> 42:36.000
Can you risk letting her know?

42:36.080 --> 42:38.000
If anyone learns
that the real Chaos Pearl…

42:38.080 --> 42:40.960
All the people who know that secret
cannot talk anymore.

42:41.720 --> 42:43.200
I will not tell Qiumin.

42:45.640 --> 42:47.920
Even when I die.

42:48.000 --> 42:49.800
That place is still there.

42:50.320 --> 42:52.280
Traces from back then can be found
in Moonlight Heights.

42:53.640 --> 42:54.520
I know

42:55.040 --> 42:57.520
that you don't want to be anywhere close
to the place your sister lived.

42:58.040 --> 42:59.600
But considering the situation,

43:00.800 --> 43:02.320
we'd better make plans in advance.

43:04.480 --> 43:05.960
Someone is there.

43:10.480 --> 43:11.560
Is that real?

43:12.480 --> 43:14.400
My mother loved Sang Qi.

43:15.160 --> 43:19.040
She was forced to marry my father
to nourish the Chaos Pearl.

43:22.880 --> 43:24.000
Qiumin!
